:= start
[let $stat = get_stat(Alice)]
Alice: I am carrying [$stat.gold] gold, and there are [party_size()] of us.
<=> shape
Bob: [richest()] is the one paying tonight, then.
Alice: Fine. Watch this.
>> hurt(Alice, 8)
Alice: ... that went badly.
<=> shape
Bob: Let's go home.
---

:= shape
[let $stat = get_stat(Alice)]
[if $stat.hp > 10]
    Alice: And I am in good enough shape to face the dragon.
[else]
    Alice: Sorry, I can't do that. I only have [$stat.hp] health points.
---
